  message: "Merged in PR #1456 (dev 05fefe416b).\n\nFixed in PR #1456 (commits 179d46a25f, 2d40bce3fa).\n- Behavior: `get_timeout()` inside `get_timeout(opts, key)` emitted edges to both the /0 and /2 clauses on dev (a self-loop). It now emits only the /0 edge (`test_a_call_of_another_arity_is_not_a_self_loop`).\n- Defaults (`\\\\`, including a bodiless head), the pipe (+1), the do block (+1, unless absorbed by keywords) and `unquote_splicing` (unknown) are each pinned by a test.\n- A multi-clause function of one arity still fans out to all its clauses (livebook do_transform/4: 12 clauses, unchanged).\n- Measured: self-call sites on livebook went 287->251 and on phoenix 118->68. All 28 phoenix dropped sites were read; each calls an arity no local clause has.\n\nIntegration: the first stage-8 integration run failed the scoped coverage gate on 13 new lines (elixir/nim/cpp); fixed by 1788619572 (tests + 3 justified pragmas) before merge."  # 18b1
